```

Install plugins into `HttpClient`:
```kotlin
HttpClient(engine) {
    install(WebSockets) {
        pingIntervalMillis = 15_000 // Automated Heartbeat Ping every 15s to keep NAT tunnels alive
        maxFrameSize = Long.MAX_VALUE
    }
    install(SSE)
}
```

